Subject: [PATCH 19/19] ttf: read vertical metrics

vhea and vmtx were not read, so a font with vertical metrics (most CJK fonts) compiled
without them. Each glyph's vmtx advance is its Glyphs vertWidth, and its origin (the top
of its bounding box plus its top side bearing) its vertOrigin, measured down from the
typographic ascender as Glyphs does; vhea's ascender, descender and line gap are the
master's vheaVertAscender, vheaVertDescender and vheaVertLineGap.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
